{"id":"cielo","lemma":"cielo","pos":"noun","rank":429,"glosses":["sky","heaven"],"ipa":"/ˈθjelo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cielos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-cielo.wav","formAudio":{"cielos":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-cielos.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"El cielo es azul.","en":"The sky is blue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39214"},{"text":"En el principio creó Dios los cielos y la tierra.","en":"In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/825834"},{"text":"El cielo está despejado.","en":"The sky is clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444248"},{"text":"Golondrinas vuelan por los cielos.","en":"Swallows are flying in the sky."},{"text":"El cielo estaba gris.","en":"The sky was gray.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/443916"}]}